OL,3,GNEWSAFA Cup and tv debut for village
OL,4,Aclub Knowle FC
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village club is making its FA Cup and
OL,7,Ftv debut with more than 1,000 tickets
OL,8,Fsold.
OL,10,FWest Midlands team Knowle FC is playing
OL,11,Fin the cup's first round qualifying for
OL,12,Fthe first time in its 100 year history.
OL,13,FThe tie, against Worcester City on
OL,14,FSaturday, will be streamed on BBC
OL,15,FiPlayer.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
