OL,3,GNEWSAFA Cup and tv debut for village
OL,4,Aclub Knowle FC
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe most tickets previously sold at the
OL,7,FRobins Nest ground was 150, manager
OL,8,FClive Seeley said. "In terms of
OL,9,Fpublicity and money, it's club
OL,10,Fchanging. There is a lot of excitement
OL,11,Faround the village and we can't wait,"
OL,12,Fhe said.
OL,14,FKnowle, a village of up to 11,000
OL,15,Fresidents, is near Solilhull. Founded
OL,16,Fin 1926 the men's team currently play
OL,17,Fin the United Counties League Premier
OL,18,FLeague South.
